sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 82 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.965 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no indica malas prácticas. Puede deberse a factores como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No refleja actos ilícitos ni decisiones equivocadas.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden necesidades similares. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas distintas. Analizar si los contratos al límite se distribuyen según criterios objetivos.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 113 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 15.8 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 7.2, with a 95% confidence interval of 5.3 to 9.7. December accounts for 13% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 11% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 5. Contract [1], for 14,965 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the high number of unique awardees do not indicate improper conduct. Statistical patterns can reflect market conditions or budget constraints, not wrongdoing. The data alone does not prove any breach of rules or misuse of funds.\nWhat can be checked: Check the contracts awarded in December for consistency with the body’s needs. Verify if multiple contracts cover the same service or supply. Review awardee A’s contracts to ensure no single provider holds an unfair advantage. Contract [1] should be examined for its specific terms and alignment with the body’s requirements.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["6k1Gfo9ZvhZ9Zh%2FyRJgM8w%3D%3D","WTPfSi4GS6bkY6rls5tG9A%3D%3D","HBiZXz%2F9Jn8ZDGvgaZEVxQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}